<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wait for meeee!!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh no!\nI fell asleep and blew my chance\fto be the first one here...\rStupid, stupid me...\nSob...sob...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stupid, stupid me...\nSob...sob...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Click, click, click...\nOh! It’s you!\rI’m over bein’ first all\nthe time.\rNow I count how many people\ncome to the Battle Frontier.\fAin’t nobody ask me to.\fIt’s just a hobby. Don’t judge.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can’t stop shakin’!\rI told my fam I’d run the\nBattle Frontier when I left home...\rBut now I’m here, and somehow I\ncan’t stop shakin’!\rWhat I’mma do if I get\nbeat to a pulp?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...You look real young.\r...\n...\rI’mma pull myself together and\nchallenge the Battle Frontier...\fMaybe!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’mma pull myself together and\nchallenge the Battle Frontier!\r...\nOr I might not!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Finally!\nI’m at the Battle Frontier!\rWhen scraps on the road don’t\nhit no more, you\fgotta come to the Battle Frontier!\rAin’t that right?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Normally, pickin’ homies is all\nthere is to a scrap.\rBut when you switch up the rules\nor limits, the scrap suddenly\fget way more fun.\rAnd the spot where you get that fun...\nis the Battle Frontier!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the Battle Frontier\rPull Up, Proud Hustlers\nAim for the Top!</language>
	</row>
</body>
